## 🤖 llm-ai-agent/README
 

A multilingual AI agent that combines **RAG** (Retrieval-Augmented Generation), **REST API integration**, 
and **conversational memory** to answer questions about occupational safety and industrial maintenance.

The agent autonomously decides **which tools to use** based on the user`s question, and can combine multiple 
tools in a single query.



## ✨ FEATURES 

- 🧠 **Autonomous tool routing**          — A multilingual semantic router decides between RAG, API, or no tool.
- 📚 **RAG(Retrieval-Augmented Generation)- Searches internal PDF documents using FAISS + sentence-transformers.
- 🖥️ **REST API Integration**             — Consults a local FastAPI server for real-time machine data.
- 💬 **Conversational Memory**            — Remembers previous questions to interpret follow-ups.
- 🔀 **Multi-tool queries**               — Can combine RAG + API + Memory in a single query.
- 📎 **Source citation**                  — Answers from documents include the source file and page number.
- 🌍 **Multilingual**                     — Works in Spanish, English, German, Italian, and French.
- ✅ **Tested**                           — 18 automated tests with pytest.
- ⚙️ **Configurable**                     — All parameters centralized in `src/config.py`.
- 🎯 **Score filtering**                  — Discards low-relevance chunks using a configurable minimum score. 


## 🏗️ ARCHITECTURE 

         ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
        INDEXING PHASE (offline — runs once)
        ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

                  ┌─────────────┐
                  │  documents/ │
                  │   PDFs      │
                  └──────┬──────┘
                         │
                         ▼
          ┌─────────────────────────────┐
          │       PDF Loader            │
          │  • loads each PDF page      │
          │  • splits into chunks       │
          │  • keeps source + page      │
          └──────────────┬──────────────┘
                         │ chunks
                         ▼
          ┌─────────────────────────────┐
          │     Embedding Model         │
          │  (sentence-transformers)    │
          │  chunk → vector             │
          └──────────────┬──────────────┘
                         │ vectors
                         ▼
          ┌─────────────────────────────┐
          │  FAISS + metadata           │
          │  (vector_store/)            │
          └─────────────────────────────┘

       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
        RUNTIME PHASE (online — runs on every query)
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

                         ┌──────────────────┐
                         │      User        │
                         └────────┬─────────┘
                                  │
                                  ▼
                    ┌──────────────────────────┐
                    │        AI Agent          │
                    │                          │
                    │  ┌────────────────────┐  │
                    │  │   Semantic Router  │  │
                    │  │   (embeddings)     │  │
                    │  │ question → vector  │  │
                    │  └─────────┬──────────┘  │
                    │            │             │
                    │            │  no confident label?
                    │            ├──────────────────────┐
                    │            │                      │
                    │            ▼                      ▼
                    │  ┌────────────────────┐  ┌────────────────┐
                    │  │  Tool Execution    │  │  LLM Fallback  │
                    │  │  (in invoke_agent) │  │ (_llm_decision)│
